{"type":"thought","data":"The codebase already"}
{"type":"thought","data":" contains TRANSPORT_RE,"}
{"type":"thought","data":" h_mad_collect_report.py,"}
{"type":"thought","data":" the collect-report "}
{"type":"thought","data":"verb, and CollectConflict."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nThe audit targets "}
{"type":"thought","data":"the plan document rather"}
{"type":"thought","data":" than the implementation."}
{"type":"thought","data":" The plan assumes the"}
{"type":"thought","data":" tree lacks these features,"}
{"type":"thought","data":" but the code already"}
{"type":"thought","data":" contains them. This"}
{"type":"thought","data":" suggests the workspace"}
{"type":"thought","data":" may already reflect"}
{"type":"thought","data":" post-implementation"}
{"type":"thought","data":" state."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nThe plan is a historical"}
{"type":"thought","data":" document from 2026-09-02"}
{"type":"thought","data":" describing pre-feature"}
{"type":"thought","data":" code. Its line numbers"}
{"type":"thought","data":" and exact code shapes"}
{"type":"thought","data":" are now stale."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nThe audit must verify"}
{"type":"thought","data":" claims against the "}
{"type":"thought","data":"current working directory."}
{"type":"thought","data":" Paths and line numbers"}
{"type":"thought","data":" cited in the plan describe"}
{"type":"thought","data":" the author's pre-implementation"}
{"type":"thought","data":" environment, not the"}
{"type":"thought","data":" present tree."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nI need to locate the"}
{"type":"thought","data":" plan document file "}
{"type":"thought","data":"and verify whether this"}
{"type":"thought","data":" workspace is the feature"}
{"type":"thought","data":" branch. I will read"}
{"type":"thought","data":" the relevant functions"}
{"type":"thought","data":" to check if the plan's"}
{"type":"thought","data":" descriptions of current"}
{"type":"thought","data":" behavior match the "}
{"type":"thought","data":"tree, while avoiding"}
{"type":"thought","data":" contradictions caused"}
{"type":"thought","data":" by post-implementation"}
{"type":"thought","data":" line-number drift."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nI will check the git"}
{"type":"thought","data":" history to confirm "}
{"type":"thought","data":"whether this workspace"}
{"type":"thought","data":" is a pre-implementation"}
{"type":"thought","data":" snapshot. I also need"}
{"type":"thought","data":" to verify the actual"}
{"type":"thought","data":" GATE_RE pattern and"}
{"type":"thought","data":" the _collected_path"}
{"type":"thought","data":" function signature "}
{"type":"thought","data":"against the plan's assumptions."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nThe actual GATE_RE"}
{"type":"thought","data":" regex allows optional"}
{"type":"thought","data":" trailing tokens, but"}
{"type":"thought","data":" the plan assumes it"}
{"type":"thought","data":" ends strictly after"}
{"type":"thought","data":" `should=(\\d+)`. This"}
{"type":"thought","data":" contradicts the plan's"}
{"type":"thought","data":" description of current"}
{"type":"thought","data":" platform behavior."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nThe GATE_RE discrepancy"}
{"type":"thought","data":" might be a pre-existing"}
{"type":"thought","data":" issue rather than a"}
{"type":"thought","data":" post-implementation"}
{"type":"thought","data":" change. I need to check"}
{"type":"thought","data":" git history and the"}
{"type":"thought","data":" audit gate code to "}
{"type":"thought","data":"see if the regex was"}
{"type":"thought","data":" always permissive. "}
{"type":"thought","data":"If the plan's exact-match"}
{"type":"thought","data":" requirement is based"}
{"type":"thought","data":" on an outdated assumption,"}
