{"type":"thought","data":"The plan file is located"}
{"type":"thought","data":" at docs/01-plan/features/audit-report-docs-copy."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nThe code's GATE_RE"}
{"type":"thought","data":" regex is more permissive"}
{"type":"thought","data":" than the plan's assumption"}
{"type":"thought","data":" table. The plan requires"}
{"type":"thought","data":" exact must and should"}
{"type":"thought","data":" counts, but the code"}
{"type":"thought","data":" tolerates trailing "}
{"type":"thought","data":"fields because the gate"}
{"type":"thought","data":" appends gated=N. I "}
{"type":"thought","data":"need to verify whether"}
{"type":"thought","data":" this change was part"}
{"type":"thought","data":" of this feature or "}
{"type":"thought","data":"pre-existing."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nThe comment references"}
{"type":"thought","data":" \"Wiring #91/H3\", suggesting"}
{"type":"thought","data":" this regex change may"}
{"type":"thought","data":" be from a different"}
{"type":"thought","data":" feature. I will check"}
{"type":"thought","data":" git history to determine"}
{"type":"thought","data":" whether the trailing-field"}
{"type":"thought","data":" tolerance existed when"}
{"type":"thought","data":" the plan was written."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nThe plan's GATE_RE"}
{"type":"thought","data":" assumption may have"}
{"type":"thought","data":" been correct on 2026-09-02."}
{"type":"thought","data":" The code likely changed"}
{"type":"thought","data":" after the plan was "}
{"type":"thought","data":"written. I will audit"}
{"type":"thought","data":" the plan by verifying"}
{"type":"thought","data":" its specific claims"}
{"type":"thought","data":" against the tree."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nI have mapped out "}
{"type":"thought","data":"eleven specific claims"}
{"type":"thought","data":" to verify against the"}
{"type":"thought","data":" tree. The most critical"}
{"type":"thought","data":" invariant is the gate's"}
{"type":"thought","data":" exit code: the plan"}
{"type":"thought","data":" prescribes exit 2 with"}
{"type":"thought","data":" counts, but the code"}
{"type":"thought","data":" may exit 0 on any verdict."}
{"type":"thought","data":" I will inspect the "}
{"type":"thought","data":"audit gate's transport"}
{"type":"thought","data":" refusal path to resolve"}
{"type":"thought","data":" this contradiction."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nINVALID is the audit"}
{"type":"thought","data":" gate's cannot-judge"}
{"type":"thought","data":" signal. It carries "}
{"type":"thought","data":"no counts and exits "}
{"type":"thought","data":"2. This resolves the"}
{"type":"thought","data":" contradiction: exit"}
{"type":"thought","data":" 0 is for verdicts like"}
{"type":"thought","data":" FAIL, while cannot-judge"}
{"type":"thought","data":" uses exit 2."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nThe audit gate's existing"}
{"type":"thought","data":" pattern requires counts"}
{"type":"thought","data":" in its GATE: INVALID"}
{"type":"thought","data":" line. The plan claims"}
{"type":"thought","data":" to follow the new_gate"}
{"type":"thought","data":" scaffold, which forbids"}
{"type":"thought","data":" counts on cannot-judge"}
{"type":"thought","data":" signals because zero"}
{"type":"thought","data":" reads as clean. This"}
{"type":"thought","data":" creates a direct contradiction"}
{"type":"thought","data":" between the plan and"}
{"type":"thought","data":" the existing gate behavior."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nThe audit gate's parser"}
{"type":"thought","data":" requires counts in "}
{"type":"thought","data":"its GATE: INVALID line."}
{"type":"thought","data":" Omitting counts would"}
{"type":"thought","data":" break the cycle driver's"}
{"type":"thought","data":" ability to parse the"}
{"type":"thought","data":" token. The plan's assumption"}
{"type":"thought","data":" table explicitly claims"}
{"type":"thought","data":" the regex demands exact"}
{"type":"thought","data":" counts, which directly"}
{"type":"thought","data":" conflicts with the "}
{"type":"thought","data":"cannot-judge invariant"}
{"type":"thought","data":" that forbids counts."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nThe plan's \"cannot-judge"}
{"type":"thought","data":" carries no counts\" "}
{"type":"thought","data":"claim is a must-fix "}
{"type":"thought","data":"invariant breach. The"}
{"type":"thought","data":" base invariant requires"}
{"type":"thought","data":" explicit stdout tokens"}
{"type":"thought","data":" and exit 0 for consumed"}
{"type":"thought","data":" gate verdicts. The "}
{"type":"thought","data":"existing audit gate "}
{"type":"thought","data":"parser demands counts"}
{"type":"thought","data":" and exit 2, so the "}
{"type":"thought","data":"plan's refusal pattern"}
{"type":"thought","data":" violates this core "}
{"type":"thought","data":"discipline."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nExit 2 for INVALID"}
{"type":"thought","data":" is consistent with "}
{"type":"thought","data":"signal discipline if"}
{"type":"thought","data":" the token represents"}
{"type":"thought","data":" an operational refusal"}
{"type":"thought","data":" rather than a PASS "}
{"type":"thought","data":"or FAIL verdict. The"}
{"type":"thought","data":" new_gate scaffold explicitly"}
{"type":"thought","data":" permits cannot-judge"}
{"type":"thought","data":" signals to exit 2, "}
{"type":"thought","data":"so this exit code aligns"}
{"type":"thought","data":" with the intended design."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nThe \"cannot-judge "}
{"type":"thought","data":"carries no counts\" rule"}
{"type":"thought","data":" is not a base invariant."}
{"type":"thought","data":" The base invariant "}
{"type":"thought","data":"list only requires tokens"}
{"type":"thought","data":" and exit 0 for PASS"}
{"type":"thought","data":" or FAIL verdicts, with"}
{"type":"thought","data":" non-zero exits reserved"}
{"type":"thought","data":" for operational errors."}
{"type":"thought","data":" The new_gate scaffold"}
{"type":"thought","data":" defines its own three"}
{"type":"thought","data":" invariants, but these"}
{"type":"thought","data":" are not copied into"}
{"type":"thought","data":" the base invariant "}
{"type":"thought","data":"file. The single-source"}
{"type":"thought","data":" contract invariant "}
{"type":"thought","data":"remains the relevant"}
{"type":"thought","data":" check: any template"}
{"type":"thought","data":" must match what the"}
{"type":"thought","data":" consuming gate logic"}
{"type":"thought","data":" actually treats as "}
{"type":"thought","data":"that case.\n\nThe plan's internal"}
{"type":"thought","data":" contradiction is a "}
{"type":"thought","data":"pre-existing divergence"}
{"type":"thought","data":" between the scaffold"}
{"type":"thought","data":" and the audit gate."}
{"type":"thought","data":" The base invariant "}
{"type":"thought","data":"does not forbid counts"}
{"type":"thought","data":" on cannot-judge signals,"}
{"type":"thought","data":" so this specific claim"}
{"type":"thought","data":" may not breach the "}
{"type":"thought","data":"core discipline."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nThe new_gate scaffold"}
{"type":"thought","data":" warns that zero counts"}
{"type":"thought","data":" are dangerous because"}
{"type":"thought","data":" a zero reads as clean"}
{"type":"thought","data":" and indistinguishable"}
{"type":"thought","data":" from nothing measured."}
{"type":"thought","data":" The plan's `_gate_token`"}
{"type":"thought","data":" parser checks both "}
{"type":"thought","data":"the verdict word and"}
{"type":"thought","data":" the counts, and maps"}
{"type":"thought","data":" exit code 2 to INVALID."}
{"type":"thought","data":" This means the transport"}
{"type":"thought","data":" refusal line would "}
{"type":"thought","data":"be parsed correctly "}
{"type":"thought","data":"rather than misread "}
{"type":"thought","data":"as a clean verdict."}
