{"type":"thought","data":"effort contract requires"}
#hmad-beat 03:52:34Z grok running 241s
{"type":"thought","data":" verifying stated code"}
{"type":"thought","data":" properties."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nThe quoted regex is"}
{"type":"thought","data":" stricter than the real"}
{"type":"thought","data":" parser, but this feature's"}
