{"type":"thought","data":" use a `--gated` flag."}
{"type":"thought","data":" The current output "}
{"type":"thought","data":"therefore matches both"}
{"type":"thought","data":" patterns, so this is"}
{"type":"thought","data":" not a hard gap for "}
{"type":"thought","data":"this feature. It will"}
