{"type":"thought","data":"TRANSPORT_RE is imported"}
{"type":"thought","data":" only by tests and defined"}
{"type":"thought","data":" in the gate."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nThe CLI does not import"}
{"type":"thought","data":" TRANSPORT_RE, so the"}
{"type":"thought","data":" plan is correct. FR-2's"}
{"type":"thought","data":" missing CONFLICT should"}
{"type":"thought","data":" be classified as restated."}
{"type":"thought","data":" The report will list"}
{"type":"thought","data":" all five functional"}
{"type":"thought","data":" requirements with their"}
{"type":"thought","data":" implementation classifications."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nFR-6 is implemented-as-written."}
{"type":"thought","data":" The 25 versus 23 success-criterion"}
{"type":"thought","data":" discrepancy is a contradictory"}
{"type":"thought","data":" count, not a restatement"}
{"type":"thought","data":" of the requirements."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nA missing command "}
{"type":"thought","data":"in the behavioural premise"}
{"type":"thought","data":" will be classified "}
{"type":"thought","data":"as a must-fix.\n\nShould-fix"}
{"type":"thought","data":" items include an incorrect"}
{"type":"thought","data":" test filename, a GATE_RE"}
{"type":"thought","data":" regex citation that"}
{"type":"thought","data":" omits the trailing-field"}
{"type":"thought","data":" group, and a strategy"}
{"type":"thought","data":" rule that contradicts"}
{"type":"thought","data":" FR-3 by stating \"cannot-judge"}
{"type":"thought","data":" carries no counts.\""}
{"type":"thought","data":" The Phase-7 census "}
{"type":"thought","data":"also shows a count mismatch"}
{"type":"thought","data":" and an example path"}
{"type":"thought","data":" that moved.\n\nNits include"}
{"type":"thought","data":" outdated next steps"}
{"type":"thought","data":" referencing v1.0 on"}
{"type":"thought","data":" a v1.11 plan, and a"}
{"type":"thought","data":" scope marker using "}
{"type":"thought","data":"`<feature>` instead "}
{"type":"thought","data":"of the stem required"}
{"type":"thought","data":" by the Requirements.\n\nThe base invariant"}
{"type":"thought","data":" signal discipline does"}
{"type":"thought","data":" not forbid counts for"}
{"type":"thought","data":" cannot-judge. The new_gate"}
{"type":"thought","data":" template contradicts"}
{"type":"thought","data":" the consuming gate "}
{"type":"thought","data":"logic by stating no "}
{"type":"thought","data":"counts, which is a single-source"}
{"type":"thought","data":" contract breach."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nThe plan claims to"}
{"type":"thought","data":" follow the new_gate"}
{"type":"thought","data":" scaffold's no-counts"}
{"type":"thought","data":" rule, yet it specifies"}
{"type":"thought","data":" counts for INVALID "}
{"type":"thought","data":"sections. This makes"}
{"type":"thought","data":" the plan disagree with"}
{"type":"thought","data":" its own stated template"}
{"type":"thought","data":" contract."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nThe no-counts claim"}
{"type":"thought","data":" is should-fix, not "}
{"type":"thought","data":"must-fix. The correct"}
{"type":"thought","data":" repair is to correct"}
{"type":"thought","data":" the strategy sentence"}
{"type":"thought","data":" rather than drop counts,"}
{"type":"thought","data":" because removing them"}
{"type":"thought","data":" would break GATE_RE."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nFR-5 and AC-5.3 are"}
{"type":"thought","data":" confirmed correct. "}
{"type":"thought","data":"The exec option loop"}
{"type":"thought","data":" is cited at 2493-2499"}
{"type":"thought","data":" but actually appears"}
{"type":"thought","data":" at 3063-3071; the flag"}
{"type":"thought","data":" set matches. Unlink"}
{"type":"thought","data":" lines 92 and 169 are"}
{"type":"thought","data":" stale anchors because"}
{"type":"thought","data":" HEAD moved that code"}
{"type":"thought","data":" to 271 inside `_finalize_write`."}
{"type":"thought","data":" These line drifts will"}
{"type":"thought","data":" be bundled into one"}
{"type":"thought","data":" should-fix."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nLine-number drift "}
{"type":"thought","data":"in unlink and exec anchors"}
{"type":"thought","data":" is likely just natural"}
{"type":"thought","data":" file growth, so treating"}
{"type":"thought","data":" those as plan defects"}
{"type":"thought","data":" is questionable. The"}
{"type":"thought","data":" GATE_RE regex mismatch"}
{"type":"thought","data":" is more serious because"}
{"type":"thought","data":" it concerns the pattern"}
{"type":"thought","data":" text itself rather "}
{"type":"thought","data":"than line numbers. A"}
{"type":"thought","data":" comment citing Wiring"}
{"type":"thought","data":" #91/H3 suggests trailing"}
{"type":"thought","data":" fields may have been"}
{"type":"thought","data":" introduced after 2026-09-02,"}
{"type":"thought","data":" but without git history"}
{"type":"thought","data":" that cannot be confirmed."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nThe GATE_RE regex "}
{"type":"thought","data":"mismatch will be reported"}
{"type":"thought","data":" as a class measurement"}
{"type":"thought","data":" should-fix. The cited"}
{"type":"thought","data":" pattern does not match"}
{"type":"thought","data":" the current `h_mad_audit_cycle.py`"}
{"type":"thought","data":" line 55, which tolerates"}
{"type":"thought","data":" trailing fields. The"}
{"type":"thought","data":" cause will be marked"}
{"type":"thought","data":" as compared to HEAD,"}
{"type":"thought","data":" since git history is"}
{"type":"thought","data":" unavailable."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nThe Phase-7 census"}
{"type":"thought","data":" count is confirmed "}
{"type":"thought","data":"wrong against the current"}
{"type":"thought","data":" tree: the plan cites"}
{"type":"thought","data":" 7, but the equivalent"}
{"type":"thought","data":" run yields 4. The example"}
{"type":"thought","data":" file has moved to the"}
{"type":"thought","data":" archive. This will "}
{"type":"thought","data":"be a should-fix measurement"}
{"type":"thought","data":" while the design conclusion"}
{"type":"thought","data":" remains valid.\n\nThe"}
{"type":"thought","data":" `find docs -name 'audit_*'`"}
{"type":"thought","data":" check still returns"}
{"type":"thought","data":" zero, so it needs no"}
{"type":"thought","data":" flag.\n\nThe 40 acceptance"}
{"type":"thought","data":" criteria are verified"}
{"type":"thought","data":" as unique.\n\nThe plan"}
{"type":"thought","data":" references `test_h_mad_audit_cycle_slices.py`,"}
{"type":"thought","data":" which does not exist."}
{"type":"thought","data":" This is a must-fix "}
{"type":"thought","data":"because the implementer"}
{"type":"thought","data":" is instructed to run"}
{"type":"thought","data":" that test after each"}
{"type":"thought","data":" documentation edit.\n\nThe real test is `test_h_mad_audit_cycle_docs.py`."}
{"type":"thought","data":" The plan cites a missing"}
{"type":"thought","data":" file, which would cause"}
{"type":"thought","data":" a collection error "}
{"type":"thought","data":"if executed literally."}
{"type":"thought","data":" Because the specification"}
{"type":"thought","data":" AC-5.2 names the correct"}
{"type":"thought","data":" file and the anchors"}
{"type":"thought","data":" still locate the intended"}
{"type":"thought","data":" section, this is a "}
{"type":"thought","data":"should-fix rather than"}
{"type":"thought","data":" a hard contract gap."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nThe plan's FR-2 contract"}
{"type":"thought","data":" adds `[forced=1]` to"}
{"type":"thought","data":" the CONFLICT line, "}
{"type":"thought","data":"which aligns with AC-2.5"}
{"type":"thought","data":" and is not a defect."}
{"type":"thought","data":" The architecture also"}
{"type":"thought","data":" confirms that CONFLICT"}
{"type":"thought","data":" exits 0 and follows"}
{"type":"thought","data":" the `COLLECT: MISSING|CONFLICT`"}
{"type":"thought","data":" pattern."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nThe plan does not "}
{"type":"thought","data":"emit the literal `COLLECT:"}
{"type":"thought","data":" CONFLICT` token. It"}
{"type":"thought","data":" only uses the `COLLECT:"}
{"type":"thought","data":" MISSING|CONFLICT` alternation"}
{"type":"thought","data":" in goals and architecture,"}
{"type":"thought","data":" omitting OK."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nThe plan's goals and"}
{"type":"thought","data":" requirements contradict"}
{"type":"thought","data":" each other. Goals list"}
{"type":"thought","data":" `COLLECT: MISSING|CONFLICT`"}
{"type":"thought","data":" but omit OK, while "}
{"type":"thought","data":"requirements list `COLLECT:"}
{"type":"thought","data":" OK|MISSING` but omit"}
{"type":"thought","data":" CONFLICT. The specification"}
{"type":"thought","data":" defines the full three-way"}
{"type":"thought","data":" token as `COLLECT: "}
{"type":"thought","data":"OK|MISSING|CONFLICT`."}
{"type":"thought","data":" This is a stronger "}
{"type":"thought","data":"finding than a simple"}
{"type":"thought","data":" omission."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nThe earlier reading"}
{"type":"thought","data":" of the goals line as"}
{"type":"thought","data":" a competing grammar"}
{"type":"thought","data":" was wrong. It correctly"}
{"type":"thought","data":" identifies the two "}
{"type":"thought","data":"non-OK verdicts that"}
{"type":"thought","data":" are never gated, while"}
{"type":"thought","data":" the requirements line"}
{"type":"thought","data":" is the actual defect"}
{"type":"thought","data":" because it omits CONFLICT"}
{"type":"thought","data":" from the grammar. The"}
{"type":"thought","data":" FR-2 quote will be "}
{"type":"thought","data":"taken verbatim from "}
{"type":"thought","data":"the plan file."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nThe FR-2 restatement"}
{"type":"thought","data":" will be quoted verbatim"}
{"type":"thought","data":" from both the plan "}
{"type":"thought","data":"and the specification."}
{"type":"thought","data":" The plan omits CONFLICT"}
{"type":"thought","data":" from its COLLECT token,"}
{"type":"thought","data":" while the spec includes"}
{"type":"thought","data":" it. Each finding must"}
{"type":"thought","data":" cite both forms under"}
{"type":"thought","data":" one bullet."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nThe exact verbatim"}
{"type":"thought","data":" span for the FR-2 finding"}
{"type":"thought","data":" is `COLLECT: OK|MISSING"}
{"type":"thought","data":" path=<docs path>`, "}
{"type":"thought","data":"copied verbatim from"}
{"type":"thought","data":" line 46 of the plan"}
{"type":"thought","data":" file."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nThe 23-mutation count"}
{"type":"thought","data":" is a measurement, not"}
{"type":"thought","data":" a document quote. The"}
{"type":"thought","data":" seven-of-eight skip"}
{"type":"thought","data":" line must be quoted"}
{"type":"thought","data":" verbatim from lines"}
{"type":"thought","data":" 13–14, including the"}
{"type":"thought","data":" backticks around `nlm-cli-version-pin`."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nThe seven-of-eight"}
{"type":"thought","data":" skip line and the assumption"}
{"type":"thought","data":" table will be merged"}
{"type":"thought","data":" into one finding about"}
{"type":"thought","data":" censuses without commands."}
{"type":"thought","data":" The 21/21 overlap line"}
{"type":"thought","data":" is only partial because"}
{"type":"thought","data":" it omits the exact "}
{"type":"thought","data":"`cmp -s` command. The"}
{"type":"thought","data":" must-fix will target"}
{"type":"thought","data":" the seven-of-eight "}
{"type":"thought","data":"skip line, which contains"}
{"type":"thought","data":" neither a command nor"}
{"type":"thought","data":" cycle IDs."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nThe handoff file lists"}
{"type":"thought","data":" cycles 8 and 10–15,"}
{"type":"thought","data":" which are exactly seven"}
{"type":"thought","data":" of eight consecutive"}
{"type":"thought","data":" cycles. This confirms"}
{"type":"thought","data":" the plan’s “seven of"}
{"type":"thought","data":" eight consecutive” "}
{"type":"thought","data":"skip census matches "}
{"type":"thought","data":"the actual repository"}
{"type":"thought","data":" state, so the finding"}
{"type":"thought","data":" is a measurement issue"}
{"type":"thought","data":" rather than a contract"}
{"type":"thought","data":" gap."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nThe handoff’s key "}
{"type":"thought","data":"learning claims eight"}
{"type":"thought","data":" consecutive cycles "}
{"type":"thought","data":"were skipped, which "}
{"type":"thought","data":"contradicts the detailed"}
{"type":"thought","data":" list naming only seven."}
{"type":"thought","data":" The plan’s “seven of"}
{"type":"thought","data":" eight” matches the "}
{"type":"thought","data":"detailed list, so the"}
{"type":"thought","data":" count is likely correct"}
{"type":"thought","data":" and the key learning"}
{"type":"thought","data":" is sloppy. Severity"}
{"type":"thought","data":" is downgraded to a "}
{"type":"thought","data":"missing command rather"}
{"type":"thought","data":" than a census error."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nThe seven-of-eight"}
{"type":"thought","data":" skip census will be"}
{"type":"thought","data":" a must-fix rather than"}
{"type":"thought","data":" a should-fix measurement."}
{"type":"thought","data":" The orchestrator can"}
{"type":"thought","data":" judge whether the missing"}
{"type":"thought","data":" command is a hard breach"}
{"type":"thought","data":" of the plan’s motivational"}
{"type":"thought","data":" sentence. The real "}
{"type":"thought","data":"build defects remain"}
{"type":"thought","data":" the CONFLICT omission"}
{"type":"thought","data":" and the 25-mutation"}
{"type":"thought","data":" count. Files opened"}
{"type":"thought","data":" for review include "}
{"type":"thought","data":"h_mad_new_gate.py, h_mad_audit_cycle.py,"}
{"type":"thought","data":" and h_mad_audit_gate.py."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nThe review now covers"}
{"type":"thought","data":" roughly nine files,"}
{"type":"thought","data":" including the plan,"}
{"type":"thought","data":" spec, dispatch script,"}
{"type":"thought","data":" and handoff. About "}
{"type":"thought","data":"fourteen grep searches"}
{"type":"thought","data":" are planned to locate"}
{"type":"thought","data":" collected-path helpers,"}
{"type":"thought","data":" version regexes, INVALID"}
{"type":"thought","data":" sections, mutation "}
{"type":"thought","data":"names, and gate patterns."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nThe review will cite"}
{"type":"thought","data":" 9 files opened and "}
